      "summary": {
        "text": "Lars Kern (born 18 November 1987) is a German racing driver. He currently competes in the 2025 IMSA SportsCar Championship driving the No. 13 AWA Chevrolet Corvette Z06 GT3.R. Kern is the GTD class winner of the 2025 24 Hours of Daytona with AWA and the SP-X class winner of the 2016 24 Hours of Nürburgring. He was part of the Manthey crew that won the 2021 24 Hours of Nürburgring overall, but was unable to race due to illness.",
        "lang": "en",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lars_Kern"
